.358 was an EXECUTION wipeout: exp3871 (EBT kill-gate) blocked on a one-line
import bug (import scripts.thesis_a_part_b_scaled), then exp3873-3880
SKIP-cascaded behind a poison pretest + gated_on retire-on-skip. The three
operator-seeded forward bets never produced verdicts.

.359 re-issues all three with the engineering fixed:
- EBT import bug fixed (sys.path.insert, not scripts.thesis_a_part_b_scaled);
  exp3881 asserts it importable as a Phase-0 green-gate.
- No hard gated_on on the critical path — in-script disk-read-with-fallback
  (the .340 proven-safe pattern); a skipped upstream costs one task, not a chain.
- Bare scalar field emission (exp3871 wrapped every value in a {value,principle}
  dict and broke the summarizer).
- All tasks codex+requires_codex+gpt-5.5; GPU tasks via .venv/bin/python.

11 tasks / 5 phases: EBT energy-as-generator kill-gate + System-2 K-curve;
in-distribution moat scissor (corpus + scissor); de-fabricated graph-grounding
facts verifier + complementarity; FR-11 v24 self-learning; GateMate + PolarFire
/KV260 continuity; capstone. paper_ready stays TRUE; FoVer 0.9131 frozen.

Added 6 verified references (NRGPT 2512.16762, Self-Verification Dilemma
2602.03485, ThinkPRM 2504.16828, HalluGraph 2512.01659, parallel p-bit Ising
2604.17109 / 2504.04543). Lints green (exclusion-manifest 0 HARD, canonical-url,
overdue-priority); adversarial review NON-BLOCKER.

